      "author_association": "NONE",
      "body": "Rebased onto `main` (`bb13e3bd`) to clear the conflict.\n\nThe change set is unchanged: the three call sites now go through\n`current_platform.clear_memory()` / `current_platform.synchronize()`, re-applied on\ntop of the residency/optimizer-chain refactor that landed on `main` in the meantime.\nThe regression test was updated accordingly — `_offload_optimizer_states()` on `main`\nnow always reaches the platform sync, so the release-path assertion was made\nindependent of that internal detail and a case for the full release path was added.\n\nNote: pushing the new head dismissed the two approvals from `Le8r0nJames` and\n`sitabulaixizawaluduo`. `mergeable` is `True` again, so a re-review would be welcome.",
